From b6f6eaadedbfb0214c8d69c13be3fefb3bf34cab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon <resands@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:22:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] input: pads through SDL3, DualShock 2 rumble from
 scePadSetActDirect

SDL3 gamepad subsystem only (raylib keeps the window); port N = N-th pad, hotplug.
Large motor -> low-frequency, small on/off -> high-frequency. Motors stop on state load
and at exit. gamepadButtons() lets overrides read pad buttons without raylib.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012y1nSfv93fXvHwE3EdxcbN
